  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): イヌドクサ",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%A4%E3%83%8C%E3%83%89%E3%82%AF%E3%82%B5",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 107366407,
      "text": "イヌドクサ はトクサ科のシダ植物の1つ。トクサによく似ているが、普通は一回り細く、また直立する茎に少数の側枝を生じる点で区別される。英名は common horsetail である。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Equisetum ramosissimum",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Equisetum_ramosissimum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1351908907,
      "text": "Equisetum ramosissimum Desf., known as branched horsetail, is a species of evergreen horsetail."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Equisetum ramosissimum",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Equisetum_ramosissimum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 168743545,
      "text": "Equisetum ramosissimum, o cola de caballo es un helecho de la familia botánica Equisetaceae."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Equisetum ramosissimum",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Equisetum_ramosissimum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 165013543,
      "text": "Equisetum ramosissimum, communément appelée Prêle rameuse ou Prêle très rameuse, est une espèce de prêles présente en Europe. Elle se propage principalement par voie végétative. Par hybridation avec Equisetum hyemale elle donne Equisetum × moorei."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Equisetum ramosissimum",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Equisetum_ramosissimum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29441097,
      "text": "Equisetum ramosissimum Desf., yang dikenal sebagai ekor kuda bercabang, adalah spesies ekor kuda hijau abadi."
    }
